        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#5A6B7A', marginTop: 10 }}>· 继承与方法重写</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 0, top: 0, width: '1280px', height: '720px' }}>
        <svg width='1280' height='720' viewBox='0 0 1280 720'>
            <rect x='64' y='96' width='368' height='330' rx='12' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#D8E3EE' /><rect x='64' y='96' width='368' height='4' rx='2' fill='#1F5FA8' /><text x='82' y='130' fontSize='15.5' fontWeight='bold' fill='#1F5FA8' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>2.6 继承：不重复造轮子</text><text x='82' y='169.0' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· 继承解决的是这个问题：</text><text x='82' y='197.5' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· 三个要点：</text><text x='82' y='226.0' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· 关于 super() 的一个实用提醒：super().__init__()</text><text x='82' y='245.5' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'> 必须放在自己赋值属性之前…</text><rect x='468' y='96' width='368' height='330' rx='12' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#D8E3EE' /><rect x='468' y='96' width='368' height='4' rx='2' fill='#1F5FA8' /><text x='486' y='130' fontSize='15.5' fontWeight='bold' fill='#1F5FA8' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>2.7 方法重写与多态</text><text x='486' y='169.0' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· 多态（polymorphism） 是重写带来的最大好处：调用</text><text x='486' y='188.5' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>代码不需要知道对象的真实类型。</text><rect x='872' y='96' width='368' height='330' rx='12' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#D8E3EE' /><rect x='872' y='96' width='368' height='4' rx='2' fill='#1F5FA8' /><text x='890' y='130' fontSize='15.5' fontWeight='bold' fill='#1F5FA8' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>2.8 导入类与 Python 标准库（教材 9.4 /…</text><text x='890' y='169.0' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· 一、类也可以拆到文件里。 和第 7 单元的函数模块完</text><text x='890' y='188.5' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>全一样，一个 .py 文件放一个类（或一组相关类）…</text><text x='890' y='217.0' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· 二、标准库：不用装，import 就能用。 教材 9.5 只</text><text x='890' y='236.5' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>举了 random 一个例子，但它是理解标…</text><text x='890' y='265.0' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· 三、随机要能复现。 random.seed(n) 固定随机序列，</text><text x='890' y='284.5' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>同一个 seed 每次跑出来的结果完全…</text><rect x='64' y='574' width='1152' height='66' rx='12' fill='#EEF5FB' /><text x='84' y='616' fontSize='14' fill='#243444' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>看不懂的地方先回讲义对应小节读一遍，再回来对着这页复述一次——能讲出来才算真懂。</text>
